{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "221cbeb3865a4927a29a9507dda54e25104ce5663ca699d3c8af50f5b9630d81", "ja": "プロレスのすゝめ", "zh": "摔角之劝", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "64e3eba7de235650a3352cb9004fc8bb8b491c5226aca66dd3d14bdd98ca609b", "ja": "プロレス団体との仕事が決まり、湧き上がる\nアイドル達。のり子の熱量は高く、説明にも\n力が入るが……突然、翼が仕事の交代を言い\n出す。理由を聞き絶望したのり子はプロレス\nの魅力を知ってもらうため、立ち上がる！", "zh": "与职业摔跤团体的工作敲定后，偶像们欢欣雀跃。  \n乃莉子的热情高涨，讲解时也格外卖力，可是……翼却突然提出要交换工作。  \n听到理由后大受打击的乃莉子，为了让大家了解职业摔跤的魅力，站了出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f109c66387db469161bc6da324649f2ae5013bb27ca22f85856ec4214fe87e08", "ja": "（早速、先方のプロレス団体との話が決まった。\nメンバーを集めて、キックオフミーティングだ！）", "zh": "（对方的职业摔跤团体那边也很快谈妥了。\n把成员召集起来，开个启动会议吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "74f6979d23ac484b5c8218550b38011099fd1f1b313c3bfc3c213c7712596037", "ja": "……というわけで、次のBOTはプロレスとの\nコラボに決定した！　みんな、よろしくな！", "zh": "……事情就是这样，下一场BOT决定要和\n职业摔角联动了！各位，就拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "193a275c223e54e27491511783b7e7b88be5e8f8f13f832c3f7402d67e6275ad", "ja": "ぃいいやったあああああっ！！！\nよし！　よし！　よぉぉぉし！！", "zh": "太太太太棒啦啊啊啊！！！\n好！好！好啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "59f67425771e3507a6bccb62a19808739867ea2b0518b69e4eb1b9377c1131c4", "ja": "のり子ちゃんのテンションがすごい……。\nこれって、私たちも出場するんですよね？", "zh": "诺丽子的情绪真高涨……\n这个比赛，我们也要参加对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "c1100f399133eeaf10588fdeab1d4fe3520d5101231f02386d31853a87cbc4e9", "ja": "春香。もしかして\nリングに上がるって聞いて、心配してるの？", "zh": "春香，你该不会是听说要上擂台，所以在担心吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "efb0a17b26830f9cef0bc99c295d3947adcf0c5ffe72902018c3e5ebb153855c", "ja": "うう、だって……もちろん、お仕事だからがんばります\nけど、やっぱり、ちょっとだけ、怖いかもって。", "zh": "嗯，因为……虽说是工作，我当然会努力，\n但果然还是觉得，可能有一点点害怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "38832dc8e4e08af4d776e56f04f35c416dc3dd8dccb973909181b184b9ec7f2e", "ja": "そうですよね……。プロレスって、投げられたり、\n高いところから落とされたりとか……？", "zh": "是啊……职业摔跤不是会被摔出去，\n或者从高处摔下来之类的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "26352fad2b1b8007fa68cb46d18cc1914c0c87e2bee34b14e2ab5ad357e5ec40", "ja": "えーっ、こわ～い！\nそんなことされちゃうの？", "zh": "诶——好可怕！\n还会被那样对待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "d36556b9aaf8a68d54cafa45bc77dae383f942161a78997e7de44cd46175b805", "ja": "大丈夫、そこは安心して！　アタシたちが出るのは、\nアングルだから。基本はMCだけだと思うよ。", "zh": "没事的，这点尽管放心！我们出场\n只是剧情安排而已。基本上应该只要说说话就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a0979d9321b44e83483e084149f5039cdb7a2bc10e3359ec2f7ac01472319e5", "ja": "アングル？　……角度のことですか？", "zh": "“Angle”？……是指角度吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "411341f5a2308b3cdfd5317cfdc9159c290152f25a940740e8df002e7b476ae6", "ja": "プロレスでいうアングルは、リングで試合前にやる、\n寸劇みたいなもの……ということらしいわ。", "zh": "职业摔角里所说的“angle”，似乎是指在擂台上比赛前进行的、类似短剧的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "f7347ce82e65a9bc9abae7f6a4188fd1f083027a8e5c5228adff2e66c7a31cd4", "ja": "そうそう！　プロレスって選手同士の因縁や、\n関係があって、それがわかってた方が楽しいからさ。", "zh": "对对！职业摔角选手之间会有些宿怨和关系，了解这些之后看起来才更有意思嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "db32ebac6e119f4a828a9e11b1818b37f125586a6c8f7576205bc30a924e02a1", "ja": "お客さんが試合にのめり込めるように、\nお芝居みたいなことをするんだよ！", "zh": "为了让观众能够全身心投入比赛，我们会做一些像演戏一样的安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "594803822ee3c4e5fa0cd4295cf872aac52037bc6115aa6f0df190111b117282", "ja": "そ、そうだったんだ！　じゃあ、\n技とか掛けたりはしないんだね。よかった……。", "zh": "原、原来是这样啊！那就是说，不会真的使出什么招式吧。太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "2dde3aed6edba98c2bcdfc90690601b521bbdd75c990d893cf301b5b83f4f24c", "ja": "なるほど。要は誰が仲間で誰がライバルっていうのを、\nお芝居で説明する感じなのね。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，要通过演出来说明谁是伙伴、谁是对手，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "f503992b8e13c993fab07fb2721c04d63696a52fde78bf5189453374017d60f5", "ja": "そういうことなら\n私達に声がかかった意味もわかりますね。", "zh": "这样的话，我也明白为什么会邀请我们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "863e703f8d874d2e9373b581d9d081163df86e315823287d651856d4837c91b7", "ja": "試合をするのに、ドラマがあるんですか？\nなんだか楽しそうです！", "zh": "原来比赛还有剧情的吗？感觉好像很有意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "9d71d6a346d803dcff47b24dd2e48d1a1d25733cd1ceb88a72cc73b2d00ff337", "ja": "そう！　そうなんだよ、プロレスって、\nすっごく熱いドラマでもあるんだ！", "zh": "对！就是这样，职业摔跤也是一出非常热血的戏剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "a935ac966d9d181ea3b1c12fc41a39cd6586c5d29bb7fb322e2da00ee068122c", "ja": "台本とかブックだとか、悪く言われたりもするけど\n……そう言い切っちゃうのも、違うんだよね。", "zh": "虽说也常被人说是按剧本、照套路来演，说得挺难听的\n……但直接那样一概而论，其实也不对呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "403806e37cddd7bb6b14c2c2cec19a44550e200d93e0a48f53c2e6badd8ccbed", "ja": "限られたルールの中で、素晴らしい試合を見せて、\nいかにお客さんを楽しませるかが大事っていうか！", "zh": "重要的是，在有限的规则下打出精彩的比赛，想办法让观众尽情享受比赛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "ee3145713ef110e68bd147c8c524409f83f3edfd631adfac2f4d1f4906addef8", "ja": "それに、試合の出来がブックを破ることもあってさ！\nそんな瞬間に立ち会えると、本当に感動しちゃって……", "zh": "而且，比赛的表现有时还会打破原定的剧本呢！能亲眼见证那样的瞬间，真的会让我感动不已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "d4d1868c172a4541cbfbd54cf4bc067cfb4f117b3335ad27a84702a5dee38767", "ja": "のり子、ストップ、ストップ！\nちょっと抑えよう。", "zh": "纪子，停，停！\n稍微克制一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "bb690d5deb3c71216833528b15ab9471ad4a2e90f4af65682c892d12b01bab49", "ja": "はっ！？　そ、そうだよね……！\nみんなにプロレスを語れると思ったら、つい……。", "zh": "哈！？对、对啊……！\n一想到能和大家聊职业摔角，就不由得……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5021c722fb744f033d1cd5f237763bbb36c2fc4e494ea30fbebeffdef0c78e0f", "ja": "うーん、プロレスかぁ……わたし、\n他のメンバーと入れ替えてもらえたりしませんか～？", "zh": "嗯——摔跤啊……我、我能不能和其他成员换一下～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "734bdecf05ed21f639c23d712ef9aee5776690a4246ccac13104b35dae203e8e", "ja": "クライマックスも近いし、スケジュール的にも\n今から調整っていうのは、ちょっと難しいかな。", "zh": "离最高潮也不远了，从日程上来说，现在再调整可能有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "41a1e2e44dcd82b4c81600721d9ba481176885933cd7364f372a36ff817bd070", "ja": "翼は、プロレスがイヤなのか？", "zh": "翼是不喜欢职业摔跤吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d35e96933ffcff9244dfc51f7eca91a0ca36745bf574aced64acffbb9ac156f0", "ja": "ん～。見るのはいいんですけど、\n自分でやるのはまた違うっていうか……。", "zh": "嗯～。看比赛倒是没问题，但要自己上场就不一样了，或者说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "af8405c30404226452817387265fe7859ac8e728786f10b735ec0d1bc0813236", "ja": "痛いのはイヤだし、熱血っぽいのも\nわたしのイメージとは違うかな～って……。", "zh": "我不喜欢疼痛，而且那种热血风格也和我的形象不太相符吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "c60bf5b340a7e41f6a96745680340ae3ad8206c5e3714d22e7e4ef8f3e0f1b70", "ja": "いやいやいや！　熱血とか泥臭いばかりじゃなくて、\nスタイリッシュな試合も多いから！", "zh": "不是不是不是！并不只是热血或艰苦拼搏的比赛，也有很多时尚帅气的比赛啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1034_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1d0b30840f98ee1d616aa693e7d84445d6091982c6297451caf30d8ddfc9521b", "ja": "えー、本当ですか～？", "zh": "诶——真的吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "124a0af5e081bbe772b8169d16164569fe1b31c017cebddb8166e5dbda1a0b29", "ja": "ホントホント！　それと、本当にアングルは\n痛いのとか、全然ないから、ホント！", "zh": "真的真的！而且，那个角度真的一点都不疼，真的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1036_043nor", "source_sha256": "5d9ec5b2c0cfec27f0bc2be7e91cbcabb089568cee3fca1fba0536d1fc034cbb", "ja": "翼は、プロレスのことを知らないだけなんだよ。\n……そう、翼だけじゃなくて、みんなも！", "zh": "翼只是不了解摔角而已。……没错，不只是翼，大家也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "21b0b054fc3b4e906fbc5d8e8729c6cce566ec0f4a47cabc31be8fb385f8e8d8", "ja": "もう少し知ってもらえたら、すこしは\nプロレスを好きになってくれると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "要是能再多了解一点，我觉得大家多少会喜欢上职业摔跤的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1038_043nor", "source_sha256": "bf255dddf0dd349d8a1c50d7688d8227a39e3fca20421825ca6ebdcd455c6646", "ja": "こうなったら、アタシがみんなのプロレスIQを\n高めるしかない！　みんな、アタシについてこーいっ！", "zh": "既然这样，只能由我来提高大家的职业摔跤IQ了！大家，跟我来——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0435_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0435_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "ad1e078d62493a304bfbaea3e40c19e8038b0a452a3ed9ce1bae812a38de9813", "ja": "（翼は気が乗らなそうだけど……のり子の熱意が、\nみんなを引っ張ってくれそうだ。一旦任せてみるか！）", "zh": "（虽然翼好像没什么兴致……但诺莉子的热情似乎能带动大家。先暂时交给她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
